{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the world of Urban Paranoia. You and up to three other friends communicating with proximity chat and radios must pay rent to your landlord at all costs! Dive into the randomly generated sewers with a different layout every night to scavenge left behind valuables to sell. Money you gather can be used to buy and manage equipment or buy healing items and medication. You must also manage your sanity which deteriorates from 5G cellphone towers or when you are the victim of stalking. Above ground and in the sewer you will face of against a variety of cryptids which become more tedious as your sanity becomes drained. How many days can you make it before your crew gets evicted?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3901840?t=1754545179","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3901840?t=1754545179","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901840/0e89834ba0f3ba8b41549175617c41bf6609b7ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754545179","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901840/0e89834ba0f3ba8b41549175617c41bf6609b7ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754545179","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"contains graphic violence and drug/substance abuse."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the world of Urban Paranoia. You and up to three other friends communicating with proximity chat and radios must pay rent to your landlord at all costs! Dive into the randomly generated sewers with a different layout every night to scavenge left behind valuables to 